     NX809J device overlay: auto-allow call recording in ALL countries.
     Upstream call_record_states.xml curates a legal allow/deny list and leaves
     unlisted countries as null -> CallRecorder.canRecordInCurrentCountry()
     returns false. This overlay replaces that resource with a single entry that
     marks every ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code allowed="true" (the parser comma-splits
     the iso attribute), so recording is available regardless of detected country.
     User-requested; legal responsibility for two-party-consent rests with the user.
-->
